          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon, kendisini çağıran koda bir değer döndürebilir. Bu mini oyun kullanıcı arayüzü, skoru güncellemeye yardımcı olmak için değer döndüren bir fonksiyon kullanıyor.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #D5F5E3&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #85C1E9;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    color: #7c795d;&#xA;    font-family: 'Trocchi', serif;&#xA;    font-size: 45px;&#xA;    font-weight: normal;&#xA;    line-height: 48px;&#xA;    margin: 0;&#xA;    text-align: centre&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #hud {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    max-width: 420px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Score Booster&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Add points for collecting a coin.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&quot;hud&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label&gt;Coins Collected&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;inputCoins&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; placeholder=&quot;Coins&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;updateScore()&quot;&gt;add to score&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;p&gt;Score: &lt;span id=&quot;outputScore&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function pointsFromCoins(coins) {&#xA;    return coins * 100;&#xA;   }&#xA;   function updateScore() {&#xA;    const coins = Number(document.getElementById(&quot;inputCoins&quot;).value);&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;outputScore&quot;).innerHTML = pointsFromCoins(coins);&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148012,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyondan bir şey döndürmek için, döndürülecek değerin ardından <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini ekleriz; burada olduğu gibi: <code>return status;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playerStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>status</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148013,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon dize, sayı veya boolean gibi her türden değer döndürebilir. Bu fonksiyon, <code>damage</code> içindeki sayı değerini döndürür.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"critDamage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"baseDamage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = baseDamage * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>damage</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca tek bir değer döndürebiliriz. Burada <code>return isAlive;</code> ile değişkenin içindeki boolean değeri döndürüyoruz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPlayerAlive\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isAlive = hp &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isAlive;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>isAlive</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun dönüş değerini, fonksiyonu çağırarak diğer tüm değerler gibi kullanabiliriz. Burada, değerini kullanmak için <code>playerStatus(22)</code> fonksiyonunu çağırıyoruz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playerStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStatus(\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerStatus</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>22</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148016,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döndürülen değeri bir değişkende de saklayabiliriz. Burada döndürülen değeri <code>result</code> içinde saklıyor ve konsolda görüntülüyoruz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"133\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"playerStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = playerStatus(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>result</code>, ardından <code>console</code> ve sonra <code>.</code>, <code>log</code>, <code>result</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
