            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyondan değeri döndür.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"giveMeTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(giveMeTen());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>10</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>message;</code> kodunu yazarak dizeyi döndür.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"89\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lootMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loot collected: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = lootMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>message;</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
